            "description": "[see pg. 12 in Chapter 4 Booklet for priority explanation]\n- Not Engaged & Enemy model in LOS -> Centurion Fireball\n- Enemy model within LOS and 6\" -> Gout of Flame\n- Engaged with 1 model -> Piledriver\n- Engaged with 2 models -> Animunculi Stomp\n- Engaged with 1 model -> Hammer Strike\n- Engaged with 3+ models -> Steam Blast\n- Not Engaged or Engaged -> Hammer Slam",
